Players are expected to understand and follow all systems in place. Join our communications server for more information.\n\n2. This experience is resource-intensive. A stable, modern device is recommended, as performance may vary depending on your hardware and player count.\n\n3. Some accounts will automatically be disqualified from this experience, due to security-measures against new/alternate accounts and cheaters.\n\n> Remember to 👍 & ⭐ the game to support us!\n> Make sure to join our communications server!\n\nTags: Half-Life, Half-Life 2, Garry's Mod, HL2:RP, Roleplay, RP, Sci-Fi, Dystopian, Cyberpunk, Resistance, Combine","path":"/game/4474859677-city-17","slug":"4474859677-city-17","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/8c1750233425496333d7b0118ae91ab24c986540b64a8f47bb731c08777b128b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4d121be8c54016532e50863bb0a6c1b3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":29,"visitor":11301211,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-09T20:27:13.399Z","creator":{"name":"CMB | The Universal Union","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14233281398,"name":"(PT3!!) Critical Revengeance","desc":"Welcome to Critical Revengeance! An open-world game that is a harder spin on the CA Genre (Although still heavily WIP.)\n\nPlease be aware that (MOST) of the songs in CR are from outside sources and are not original, and upon request will be removed if need be.\nWe DO have some official OSTs though.\nAZALI has granted us permission to use their songs, as long as it isn't a commissioned song.\n\nThis game is still in public testing phases, so expect MANY bugs, unfinished content, a lack of content, incorrect balancing, and anything to change. This game is mostly meant for PC, but it has some mobile and console support.\n\nThis game is developed by two people, one working on a backend recode. Game is still getting updated during recode period. Please know that updates will be way slower and inconsistent, and is a passion project.","path":"/game/14233281398-pt3-critical-revengeance","slug":"14233281398-pt3-critical-revengeance","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/d79ea6a06ad714f0bef90ddc9deb579b85c5bc082f1c51af5bc77bb5445a8574.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0056d15b022d99c2eb4b74fe738c5542/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":29,"visitor":3954045,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-12T23:08:19.323Z","creator":{"name":"The Last Strike","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6168898345,"name":"Bulwark","desc":"\"The BEST melee game on roblox\" - me\n\nPRIVATE SERVERS DO NOT SAVE DATA!!!\n\nq : feint swing\nf : kick, high knockback and bypasses parry\nr : parry, attacks people who hit you while active\ne : punch, stuns people blocking\nx : flourish \n\nA tourney is taking place in a small village, testing two large nations at feud. Tensions are at an all time high between the Kingdom of Guesmand and the Sunderland Empire. The tournament would surely give one side favor for the wars to come.\n\nsword game insp. by mordhau and chivalry. you know the deal","path":"/game/6168898345-bulwark","slug":"6168898345-bulwark","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/704c9d0df323de7daa6913436ed075078b6f30a9a8f68865d0b44b66c47f12a8.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4be3924006eb3f9eba69d3197414e950/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":29,"visitor":9750935,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-24T10:54:59.844Z","creator":{"name":"ChiaPetDie","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15684145480,"name":"Oakridge Nuclear Power Station [V0.26.12 BETA]","desc":"","path":"/game/15684145480-oakridge-nuclear-power-station-v0-26-12-beta","slug":"15684145480-oakridge-nuclear-power-station-v0-26-12-beta","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/f7de126e56fab90263c8d6a488e26976029e76832e76e709aa0bcecd60955844.webp","origina